WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.840
Google will switch off search for students aged 5-18 unless schools opt in. This is MAG 7 Daily

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:11.820
episode 43. After the school rule, Apple's coding tool, a lock that failed a demo, and

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:16.800
the money behind new halls and chips. Then the counterpoint and the calendar. Google's

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:22.140
own write up as cyber news and the SOFX report have it. Turns four products off together

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:27.780
for those student accounts. Gemini, Gemini notebook, Gemini in classroom, and search

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:30.960
all-state dark until an administrator flips a service on.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:36.020
Chris Phillips, who runs education at Google, told The New York Times the split people want

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:41.860
is not available because search and AI are deeply integrated, so a ban on the AI side

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:43.100
means no search either.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:49.100
Zoran Mamdani, the mayor of New York, called it monopoly power used to push AI into public

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:49.520
schools.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:55.020
Lena Kahn, the former Federal Trade Commission Chair, said the search monopoly is the lever,

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.700
and that schools which refuse will be punished.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.480
The decoder puts that search consequence in 2027.

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:04.860
Google also said administrators should get more detail

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:06.580
on the change in the coming months.

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:10.700
Apple, in a 9-5 Mac report matched by data economy,

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:14.120
shipped the first beta of Xcode 27.3.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:17.400
The addition that leads the notes is GitHub Copilot.

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:20.780
Now inside the coding assistant Xcode already carries.

00:01:21.813 --> 00:01:24.233
Calif, the hacker team Mac rumors filmed,

00:01:24.233 --> 00:01:29.373
kept a jailbreak alive on an iPhone 18 Pro that had lockdown mode switched on.

00:01:29.813 --> 00:01:34.293
They then installed iOS 27.2 and the jailbreak was still there.

00:01:34.893 --> 00:01:39.113
The clip starts from a malicious PDF sent over airdrop that the user accepted.

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:44.593
Apple told TechCrunch earlier this year it knew of no successful mercenary spyware hit

00:01:44.593 --> 00:01:46.593
on a phone sitting in lockdown mode.

00:01:47.113 --> 00:01:51.893
Calliff says the bugs are going to Apple and that no end user jailbreak tool is coming.

00:01:51.893 --> 00:01:57.813
2 opposition leaders in Thailand, Bloomberg reported, want their government to say whether

00:01:57.813 --> 00:02:00.733
state agencies aimed spyware at political leaders.

00:02:01.133 --> 00:02:05.013
The prompt was Apple software flagging attempted attacks on their phones.

00:02:05.693 --> 00:02:11.973
Amazon's Washington paperwork Geekwire reported, is a notice of about 95 cuts, and a spokesperson

00:02:11.973 --> 00:02:16.713
said it belongs to the store's layoffs already disclosed, not a fresh round.

00:02:16.713 --> 00:02:23.093
The roles include software engineers, product managers and program managers, mostly in Seattle,

00:02:23.653 --> 00:02:27.813
with others in Bellevue, Redmond, Sumner, Pasco or Working Remote.

00:02:28.553 --> 00:02:33.753
Reuters had put the wider stores cut under 1000 corporate jobs, touching the United States,

00:02:34.013 --> 00:02:35.413
India and the United Kingdom.

00:02:35.933 --> 00:02:42.693
The larger history in that same filing trail is about 14,000 corporate roles cut globally in October 2025,

00:02:42.693 --> 00:02:50.973
2,303 of them in Washington, then a January round that included 2,198 Washington employees.

00:02:51.493 --> 00:02:56.713
Brad Glasser, speaking for Amazon, said stores was reshaped so the structure would match

00:02:56.713 --> 00:02:57.433
the priorities.

00:02:58.073 --> 00:03:03.653
On a separate track, the company posted about 300,000 seasonal U.S. operations openings,

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:08.493
and seasonal staff on at least 30 hours a week can take health coverage from January

00:03:08.493 --> 00:03:15.713
1st, 2027. Plans from $5 a week with $5 co-pays after a September pledge of more than

00:03:15.713 --> 00:03:19.893
one-and-a-half billion dollars in extra pay for U.S. operations employees.

00:03:20.857 --> 00:03:27.777
Apple's iOS 27.3 beta is in Tester's hands now. Mac rumors reported, after the window

00:03:27.777 --> 00:03:32.557
for that beta had already been set. Apple intelligence features are in the China set

00:03:32.557 --> 00:03:35.077
on that build, and Siri AI is not.

00:03:35.617 --> 00:03:38.677
Technode says the China developer beta ties in Quinn.

00:03:39.437 --> 00:03:42.817
Free Malaysia today counts the China arrival as a two-year delay.

00:03:43.437 --> 00:03:48.437
The same beta lets any developer hand apps actions to Siri AI through app intents,

00:03:48.837 --> 00:03:53.657
and it adds Siri AI in traditional Chinese, Vietnamese, Turkish, and Norwegian.

00:03:54.683 --> 00:03:59.143
The financial times put Elon Musk and Mark Zuckerberg on the same governance page.

00:03:59.143 --> 00:04:04.983
A SpaceX Tesla merger and a new meta-share class are expected to blunt investor lawsuits

00:04:04.983 --> 00:04:07.843
after Delaware and Texas narrowed shareholder rights.

00:04:08.423 --> 00:04:13.043
The paper reads both as the latest step in decade-long efforts to repel those suits.

00:04:13.903 --> 00:04:19.103
Singapore's GovTech is pairing with Google DeepMind, Computer Weekly reported, to detect

00:04:19.103 --> 00:04:21.403
scams with AI that runs on the device.

00:04:22.143 --> 00:04:28.103
PYM and TS reported that worldwide express unfroze $10 million with AI agents on Amazon

00:04:28.103 --> 00:04:33.512
on web services. The case against reading the school rule as an all-or-nothing lock comes

00:04:33.512 --> 00:04:38.812
from Google's own news account, as the Sofx report transcribed it. That post said

00:04:38.812 --> 00:04:44.412
the day gives schools more choice, not less. Gemini, Gemini Notebook, and Search start-off,

00:04:44.692 --> 00:04:50.472
and an administrator can turn on one, two, or all three. AI mode and AI overviews in the

00:04:50.472 --> 00:04:54.732
school version of Search are supposed to walk a problem step-by-step instead of handing

00:04:54.732 --> 00:05:00.512
over the answer. That post is what decides whether Philips' line, that search and AI cannot

00:05:00.512 --> 00:05:07.234
be pulled apart, still means a school cannot keep search and refuse Gemini. $15 billion is what

00:05:07.234 --> 00:05:12.394
Bloomberg says Alphabet's Google plans to spend expanding data centers and cloud operations in

00:05:12.394 --> 00:05:18.554
Malaysia, with the AI boom named as the demand. The same day, business today said Amazon Web

00:05:18.554 --> 00:05:23.614
services launched Semarack AI Malaysia, three pillars aimed at getting AI adopted.

00:05:24.214 --> 00:05:26.094
Google's number is a construction budget.

00:05:26.594 --> 00:05:31.334
Amazon's launch is an adoption program, and the announcement does not hang a dollar total

00:05:31.334 --> 00:05:32.054
on those pillars.

00:05:32.714 --> 00:05:35.794
Meta is borrowing rather than pouring concrete in that story.

00:05:36.374 --> 00:05:41.394
Bloomberg said the company has opened its first Euro-Bond sale, set to pay generous yields

00:05:41.394 --> 00:05:43.854
after a $15 billion deal in dollars.

00:05:43.854 --> 00:05:49.054
The wire set that sale inside a race to finance trillions of dollars of AI investment.

00:05:49.394 --> 00:05:51.774
The Eurobook does not build a haul in Malaysia.

00:05:52.394 --> 00:05:56.734
It adds a second currency, and it prices the money at a yield the wire called generous.

00:05:57.494 --> 00:06:01.194
Yesterday, Nvidia told cloud clients to take on less China business.

00:06:01.774 --> 00:06:07.434
Today Bloomberg's figure for Chinese AI developers is 1% of a $70 billion book of advanced

00:06:07.434 --> 00:06:12.394
RTX chips they ordered, spread over the next several months, because production is not

00:06:12.394 --> 00:06:18.274
keeping up with demand. AMD, which that wire calls a key challenger to Nvidia in AI chips,

00:06:18.814 --> 00:06:24.974
forecast fourth quarter revenue of $17 billion, plus or minus 3%, and Bloomberg read the

00:06:24.974 --> 00:06:30.774
outlook as evidence that data center processor demand is still strong. That AMD line is arrival

00:06:30.774 --> 00:06:37.734
sales forecast, not a count of Nvidia boxes arriving in China. My Northwest named Amazon Web Services

00:06:37.734 --> 00:06:42.094
as the buyer on a $264 million data center land deal in West

00:06:42.094 --> 00:06:45.814
Richland, Washington. A site purchase, not a live cluster,

00:06:46.314 --> 00:06:49.814
and not the Malaysia program. The shared squeeze is capacity,

00:06:50.234 --> 00:06:54.574
buildings and power on one side, chips and the debt that pays for both on the

00:06:54.574 --> 00:06:58.074
other. Google is buying owned cloud capacity in Malaysia,

00:06:58.634 --> 00:07:01.314
Amazon is buying land at home and separately,

00:07:01.934 --> 00:07:06.154
wrapping an adoption push around Malaysia. Meta is testing whether Euro

00:07:06.154 --> 00:07:09.214
investors will fund the same build after the dollar raise.

00:07:09.854 --> 00:07:14.694
Nvidia cannot turn China's slice of that RTX book into shipments at anything like the

00:07:14.694 --> 00:07:19.574
order size, while a challenger's quarter says the buyers who can get processors are still

00:07:19.574 --> 00:07:20.014
spending.

00:07:20.714 --> 00:07:21.794
The queue is what moves.

00:07:22.414 --> 00:07:24.374
Malaysian capacity is a Google spend.

00:07:24.974 --> 00:07:27.454
Euro buyers are a new price on Meta's funding.

00:07:27.994 --> 00:07:32.294
Chinese developers holding those orders are the customers for whom almost the whole book

00:07:32.294 --> 00:07:33.854
does not convert on this run.

00:07:33.854 --> 00:07:40.614
West Richland secures dirt, not racks. The clock a wire actually set is the delivery window on those

00:07:40.614 --> 00:07:47.024
fractional Nvidia shipments. On the calendar, separations and Amazon's Washington notice begin on

00:07:47.024 --> 00:07:54.704
December 7th, 2026, and those dates run through January 25th, 2027. The decoder puts the school

00:07:54.704 --> 00:08:01.664
search and AI opt-in rule in 2027. Before we go, a December no-confidence debate in Thailand is the

00:08:01.664 --> 00:08:05.064
session those opposition leaders tied to the Apple spyware alerts.

00:08:05.644 --> 00:08:07.404
That's mag 7 daily for today.

